      });
      alert('Saved to the server!');
    };
    ```

- **Scan Fields** (rescan template fields):
  ```html
  <button class="btn" type="button" id="scanFieldsBtn" style="background:#27ae60;">Scan Fields</button>
  ```
  - Reinvoke `renderFields()` to refresh the field buttons.

## Summary

- **Template Selection**: Dropdown selection that automatically loads fields and styles.
- **Field Input Area**: Each field has a button; clicking it pops up a floating input box. After entering content, the button changes color.
- **Front/Back Switch**: Button toggle; the form action redirects to different preview interfaces.
- **Refresh/Clear/Save**: Correspond to refreshing the preview, clearing all fields, and saving field data to the server, respectively.
- **Floating Input Box**: Pops up upon clicking a field button; input content is synchronized in real time to allFieldData.

